    "body": "> I think the title should still not have the level.\r\n\r\nOK, dropped in ed1ae50\r\n\r\n> Compare to https://drafts.csswg.org/css-position/ and https://drafts.csswg.org/css-fonts/ which we also link to.\r\n\r\nTrue but notice that we also had *CSS Cascading and Inheritance Level 4* and *CSS Color Module Level 3*. So in 894ad31 I dropped the level from those too, so we now have consistency.",
