    "updated_at": "2017-09-27T23:39:54Z",
    "body": "I think the unleveled URLs should be the primary link mechanism, because the leveled content can be superseded (as @sideshowbarker notes). There will be some cases where an unleveled URL will break for good reasons (older things get deprecated in a new level) but we should be ensuring that anchors persist across spec levels in the general case.",
